  "adaptations": [
    "Use standard typed resource fixtures instead of private UnstructuredConditioned wrappers.",
    "Inject a fixed clock instead of normalizing runtime timestamps.",
    "Use the new generic Aggregate(parent, children, rules, local...) entry point.",
    "Replace the mock internal URL consistently in input and expected output with example.invalid.",
    "Select the root MultilineMessages implementation explicitly through Formatter; the separate opaque format is unchanged.",
    "Import the shared root evaluator through aliases; the Infra profile no longer contains a private evaluator copy.",
    "Use boolean-returning native setters and let Aggregate return the setter change flag directly.",
    "Exercise multiline fixtures through the public format; map the reference inline zero limit to explicit unlimited detail via a negative InlineChars value."
